  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_5351.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Esta semana ha comenzado en la sala de actividades de la biblioteca infantil de Onda una nueva edici&oacute;n de &#39;L&#39;hora del Conte&#39;, organizada por el &aacute;rea de Cultura y Educaci&oacute;n del Ayuntamiento, y dirigida a ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as de educaci&oacute;n Infantil.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/l039horadelconteoctubre14/img_5351.jpg\" alt=\"img_5351\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/l039horadelconteoctubre14/img_5352.jpg\" alt=\"img_5352\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/l039horadelconteoctubre14/img_5353.jpg\" alt=\"img_5353\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/l039horadelconteoctubre14/img_5354.jpg\" alt=\"img_5354\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/l039horadelconteoctubre14/img_5355.jpg\" alt=\"img_5355\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/l039horadelconteoctubre14/img_5356.jpg\" alt=\"img_5356\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/l039horadelconteoctubre14/img_5357.jpg\" alt=\"img_5357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/l039horadelconteoctubre14/img_5403.jpg\" alt=\"img_5403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/l039horadelconteoctubre14/img_5404.jpg\" alt=\"img_5404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><i